      children: "The digital advertising landscape has fundamentally shifted. Browser-based tracking, once the cornerstone of conversion attribution, now faces insurmountable challenges: iOS 14.5+ privacy restrictions, browser cookie blocking, ad blocker proliferation, and impending third-party cookie deprecation. For engineering teams running Facebook ad campaigns, this translates to blind spots in conversion tracking, inflated cost-per-acquisition metrics, and misallocated ad spend. The Facebook Pixel, despite its ubiquity, can only capture what browsers permit-and that permission is rapidly eroding."
